HOW TO USE THIS FILE
Rename a copy of this to resume.txt (same folder), paste your own resume text in,
and either restart LinkWatch or click "Reload extensions" in Settings. You can also
paste your resume straight into the Resume tab of the Job Hunt panel, which writes
resume.txt for you. resume.txt is gitignored, so it never gets pushed to the public
repo.
